  m_Name: tf_alone
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: LastWard.Runtime::LastWard.Puzzles.ClueDefinition
  clueId: tf_alone
  displayTitle: Folded Into A Key Envelope
  bodyText: If you are on your own then there is no fee, and that is not mercy -
    it is that there is nobody left to charge. What he wants from a single applicant
    is an ACCOUNT. The whole of it, start to end, every name and every number, and
    he will know the moment you are guessing. The ones who go down there half-informed
    do not come back up and they do not stop either. You have heard them. That is
    what the walking is.
